          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "The compact grout plants consist of the proven, standard Häny components of a mixer, agitator, and grout pump. This setup is suitable for a wide range of applications such as anchoring, sleeve pipe, contact, and backfill grouting. For higher outputs and increased quality control, the plants are also available in semi-automated and fully automated versions."
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Extremely compact mixing and injection system with central lifting point for easy transport and minimum installation time",
                "High productivity due to ergonomically positioned operating elements",
                "High reliability and low-maintenance operation with good accessibility to the wear parts",
                "Independent of pressure ratios, the suction stroke is always carried out at high velocity in order to flush the valves and to avoid clogging"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "gen": true
        },
